>  	} host_debug_state;
>  
> +	/* Guest trace filter value */
> +	u64 guest_trfcr_el1;

Guest value? Or host state while running the guest? If the former,
then this has nothing to do here. If the latter, this should be
spelled out (trfcr_in_guest?), and the comment amended.

